# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of the checkout platform —
# a CRLF shebang line (`#!/bin/sh<CR>`) fails inside a Linux container with a
# misleading "exec: no such file or directory" error. Without this, a Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true/input misconfigured, or a plain `git clone` on
# a machine defaulting to CRLF) can silently break every Dockerfile ENTRYPOINT
# in this repo.
*.sh text eol=lf
